<title>USA: Kellogg to make health-claim announcement.</title>
<headline>Kellogg to make health-claim announcement.</headline>
<dateline>BATTLE CREEK, Mich. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kellogg Co, the leading U.S. ready-to-eat cereal maker, on Monday said it would make an announcement on Tuesday regarding a new health claim.</p>
<p>In press advisory, Kellogg said it would make &quot;a new health claim with major implications for improved public health.&quot;</p>
<p>Further details about the announcement were not immediately available.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
